Pedophiles' auxiliary service was immediately filled with reservations - in Finland, about 40 000 feel interested in children
It is estimated that two per cent of men and a small proportion of women experience at least some sexual interest in pre-teens.
In Finland, this means about 40 000 people.
Until now, it has been difficult for those who are sexually attracted to children or young people.
The SeriE project, a joint venture between the Criminal Welfare Support Foundation and Sexpo, trains professionals to meet paedophiles as customers and helps people who experience sexual interest in children.
