Most of those who notice paedophilic feelings themselves have not fulfilled their fantasies and thus did nothing criminal.
However, preference is usually a permanent characteristic.
Most of them hope to get rid of the thoughts that make them anxious and depressed.
They also complicate a normal life, says sexual therapist Patricia Thesleff, who works as a specialist in the project.
In my opinion, the job is valuable if even one child is spared from sexual violence, Thesleff says.
Leaders of the Congolese or gynecologist?
U.S. President Donald Trump, the winner of the Nobel Peace Prize, may suddenly sound strange, but based on betting odds, Trump is one of the biggest favourites to win the prize.
