If I got into the winning trio and had a career for me, I don't want to believe that it would affect our relationship in any way.
Even if we have to live separately, our trust works well, and the good thing about a remote relationship is that the initial spark stays on all the time, Alina grinned in May.
Rejoicing in constant growth, death on our heels
Almost everyone is concerned about the Earth's resilience.
However, there is almost no desire to give up anything.
Sustainable alternatives are sought for continuous growth, but the theory of moderate economics also encounters major problems.
The continuous growth of the economy has, over the course of a few generations, brought ordinary people, especially in the northern hemisphere, a standard of living that could only be dreamed of in the past.
However, the long-running excess of the Earth's carrying capacity and climate change make the cornerstone of this market economy falter threateningly.
