The best place for the guests came in the 72nd minute when James Milner found Bobby Firmino.
However, the Brass star's butt was directed towards national teammate David Luizia, who saved the hosts' lead.
Even that didn't last in the 89th minute, when substitute Daniel Sturridge was free to shoot from 25 meters.
